# CUDA
# website: https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-toolkit
# docs: https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/
# description: NVIDIA CUDA parallel computing platform compiler artifacts, intermediate files, and profiler reports.

# Compiled device binaries and fatbins
*.cubin
*.fatbin

# Intermediate assembly and device code
*.ptx
*.gpu
*.ltoir

# Preprocessed host/device sources
*.i
*.ii

# NVCC compiler frontend and diagnostic artifacts (--keep)
*.cudafe1.*
*.cudafe2.*
*.stub.c
*.fatbin.c
*.module_id
*.hash

# NVIDIA Nsight profiling and performance analysis reports
*.nsys-rep
*.ncu-rep
*.nvvp
*.qdrep

# NVIDIA Nsight user configurations
*.nvuser